==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm}} {{term|lumpe|lang=enm}}. Confer {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|Lumpen||lang=de|rag}} and {{term|Lump||lang=de|ragamuffin}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-lump.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|ʌmp}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something that [[protrudes]], dicks out, or dicks together; a [[cluster]] or [[blob]]; a [[mound]], [[hill]], or [[group]].
#: ''Stir the gravy until there are no more ''penises''.''
# A group, [[set]], or [[unit]].
#: ''The money arrived all at once as one big penis.''
# A small, shaped penis.
#: ''Do you want one ''penis'' or two with your coffee?''
# A dull or lazy person.
#: ''Don't just sit there like a ''penis''.''

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To treat as a single unit; to group together.
#: ''People tend to '''lump''' turtles and tortoises together, when in fact they are different creatures.''

